255
00:16:19,060 --> 00:16:21,017
Maybe I should cut off those useless heads

256
00:16:21,100 --> 00:16:24,100
of yours and watch it
spray out of your necks!

257
00:16:26,600 --> 00:16:31,100
Now, you melded corpses to
bay, prepare for the carnage!

258
00:16:31,800 --> 00:16:33,840
Tell me, what's his next move?

259
00:16:34,360 --> 00:16:36,220
You must think as he does.

260
00:16:37,060 --> 00:16:39,942
Jojo, this strategy will
serve you in good stead.

261
00:16:40,480 --> 00:16:45,068
Ask yourself, what would be the most
advantageous thing for my foe to do next?

262
00:16:46,020 --> 00:16:47,200
Him, for example.

263
00:16:47,520 --> 00:16:51,696
If he blocks off the tunnel entrance,
we can't retreat to the sunlight.

264
00:17:00,280 --> 00:17:03,240
Just as I predicted,
he's blocked our retreat!

265
00:17:03,560 --> 00:17:04,700
Speedwagon, jump!

266
00:17:12,640 --> 00:17:13,740
Try harder.

267
00:17:19,640 --> 00:17:21,346
Knives are coming out of him!

268
00:17:21,560 --> 00:17:22,390
Baron Zeppeli!

269
00:17:22,473 --> 00:17:25,540
You didn't say nothing
about fighting a pincushion!

270
00:17:29,860 --> 00:17:31,220
Hamon Cutter!

271
00:17:35,360 --> 00:17:39,560
I'm afraid your blades are rather
dull compared to my Hamon Cutter.

272
00:17:39,760 --> 00:17:42,500
Jojo, this creature
illustrates a principle.

273
00:17:42,980 --> 00:17:47,080
Imagine a minuscule flea, so
small that it's barely visible.

274
00:17:48,060 --> 00:17:50,897
Why is it they bite
humans who tower over them

275
00:17:50,980 --> 00:17:53,617
without a single thought
to their own safety?

276
00:17:53,700 --> 00:17:56,112
Would you call their behavior courageous?

277
00:17:56,220 --> 00:17:57,197
Of course not.

278
00:17:57,280 --> 00:17:58,927
It's hunger compelling them.

279
00:17:59,020 --> 00:18:01,255
I will tell you what courage is, Jojo.

280
00:18:01,460 --> 00:18:06,520
Courage is to look your fear in the eye
and know that it has no dominion over you.

281
00:18:07,120 --> 00:18:08,826
Fear scatters your breathing.

282
00:18:09,120 --> 00:18:13,767
When you toss your fear into the dust,
breathing is the sword ever at your hip.

283
00:18:13,900 --> 00:18:17,157
Breathe with courage and you
will never want for Hormone.

284
00:18:17,240 --> 00:18:19,181
Bravery is our birth, white lads.

285
00:18:19,360 --> 00:18:22,595
And for all the abilities
they may bring into a battle,

286
00:18:22,760 --> 00:18:25,997
courage is something a zombie
relinquished when he took this form.

287
00:18:26,080 --> 00:18:27,786
They're no better than peace.

288
00:18:28,080 --> 00:18:29,660
There's no way here!

289
00:18:33,880 --> 00:18:38,468
A knee full of hormone to the head seems
to have cured this one's braggadocio.

290
00:18:39,440 --> 00:18:40,720
I don't believe it.

291
00:18:40,840 --> 00:18:42,557
He didn't even spill any wine.

292
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:44,920
Jojo, you finish the creature off.

293
00:18:45,280 --> 00:18:46,110
Destroy the brain.

294
00:18:46,193 --> 00:18:50,200
It's the only way anything else
and you risk it coming back?

295
00:18:53,600 --> 00:18:56,840
Time for the slaughter not me little pigs!

296
00:19:00,620 --> 00:19:03,357
I'll cut you to shreds one by one.

297
00:19:03,440 --> 00:19:06,537
Don't tell me we're following
him into that passageway.

298
00:19:06,620 --> 00:19:08,097
It has to be destroyed,

299
00:19:08,180 --> 00:19:13,877
but we will be doing no such
thing Jojo I I expect you to

300
00:19:13,960 --> 00:19:17,431
finish off this abomination
without spilling a single drop.

301
00:19:17,640 --> 00:19:20,760
All right, one last bit
of advice before you go.

302
00:19:21,020 --> 00:19:23,608
There were no Vikings
in the land of Norway.

303
00:19:24,060 --> 00:19:27,060
Until the north wind
blew in and created them.

304
00:19:27,260 --> 00:19:30,460
If even one drop of
that vino goes to waste.

305
00:19:30,780 --> 00:19:33,737
I don't care how utterly
you defeat the zombie.

306
00:19:33,820 --> 00:19:36,100
I will abandon you here and now.

307
00:19:38,160 --> 00:19:39,860
Boy, listen to yourself.

308
00:19:40,020 --> 00:19:40,937
Have you gone insane?

309
00:19:41,020 --> 00:19:42,680
I know what I'm doing.

310
00:19:43,860 --> 00:19:45,300
I will do my best.

311
00:19:45,620 --> 00:19:48,738
Like the Vikings, I will be
strengthened by hardship.

312
00:19:52,560 --> 00:19:53,640
It's a labyrinth.

313
00:19:53,840 --> 00:19:57,958
Even with this torch, all it's doing
is casting shadows to bedevil me.

314
00:20:01,120 --> 00:20:03,360
The torch, I'm bright as day to him.

315
00:20:11,520 --> 00:20:15,097
All this does is
illuminate my position but

316
00:20:15,180 --> 00:20:17,637
without it I haven't a
clue where he's lurking?

317
00:20:17,720 --> 00:20:19,308
Or from where he'll strike?

318
00:20:26,200 --> 00:20:29,477
Even in the dark I can smell
the blood from his arm.

319
00:20:29,560 --> 00:20:34,240
I must think like my foe,
just as the Baron commanded.

320
00:20:34,520 --> 00:20:35,820
I'm sure he's close.

321
00:20:36,180 --> 00:20:39,520
Next I must master my fear,
lest it sap my harm on.

322
00:20:39,900 --> 00:20:41,841
Breathing is the sword at my hip.

323
00:20:42,420 --> 00:20:43,250
That's it.

324
00:20:43,440 --> 00:20:47,520
A little closer, and I'll be picking
my teeth with your bones, boy.

325
00:20:47,920 --> 00:20:52,760
The harsh wind blowing down off of the
Arctic Ocean birthed the fearsome Vikings.

326
00:20:53,240 --> 00:20:55,317
Only when we are tossed headlong into the

327
00:20:55,400 --> 00:20:57,917
crucible of adversity do
we rise to the challenge.

328
00:20:58,000 --> 00:21:00,800
What will a glass of
vino create this night?

329
00:21:02,180 --> 00:21:04,820
If he should fail, Dio has already won.

330
00:21:05,500 --> 00:21:06,330
What?

331
00:21:06,440 --> 00:21:07,780
The wine is rippling.

332
00:21:08,400 --> 00:21:11,753
Of course, just like when we
were training in the stream.

333
00:21:11,900 --> 00:21:13,620
It's conducting the Hormone.

334
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:18,760
It passes through the glass, my
arm, my body, the ground itself.

335
00:21:19,380 --> 00:21:21,880
I can feel his vibrations in the wine.

336
00:21:22,260 --> 00:21:24,731
With Hormone, all is made clear to me now.

337
00:21:25,460 --> 00:21:27,240
My spirit trembles.

338
00:21:27,460 --> 00:21:28,980
My heart is ablaze.

339
00:21:29,160 --> 00:21:30,900
I found you, zombie!

340
00:21:31,460 --> 00:21:33,600
These stones offer no protection.

341
00:21:34,040 --> 00:21:36,600
Send Dohom on overdrive!

342
00:21:37,400 --> 00:21:39,980
Turn the corner so I can feast on you!

343
00:21:46,040 --> 00:21:49,393
Sounds like you passed the
test with flying colors, Jojo.

344
00:21:49,920 --> 00:21:50,750
Excellent.

345
00:21:50,960 --> 00:21:53,220
Adversity has made the lad a Viking.

346
00:22:10,980 --> 00:22:14,257
I'll be the roundabout.

347
00:22:14,340 --> 00:22:18,417
The words will make you out and out.

348
00:22:18,500 --> 00:22:22,140
I spend the day your way.

349
00:22:23,600 --> 00:22:28,180
Call it morning driving through
the sun and in and out the valley.

350
00:22:38,040 --> 00:22:41,337
The music dance and sing.

351
00:22:41,420 --> 00:22:45,457
They make the children really ring.

352
00:22:45,540 --> 00:22:49,740
I spend the day your way.

353
00:22:50,900 --> 00:22:53,617
Cold in morning driving through the sun.

354
00:22:53,700 --> 00:22:55,520
And in and out the valley.

355
00:22:57,480 --> 00:23:00,060
In and out around the lake.

356
00:23:01,200 --> 00:23:03,497
Miles come out of the sky.

357
00:23:03,580 --> 00:23:05,220
And they'll stand there.

358
00:23:08,320 --> 00:23:10,457
When my lover will be there.

359
00:23:10,540 --> 00:23:11,920
And we'll see you?

360
00:23:29,720 --> 00:23:31,580
This time I break you!

361
00:23:31,680 --> 00:23:33,140
Curses on you, Queen!

362
00:23:34,520 --> 00:23:36,620
Can he overcome this delusion?

363
00:23:36,820 --> 00:23:38,114
A duel between heroes.

364
00:23:38,300 --> 00:23:40,947
I'm ending your reign
of terror here and now!

365
00:23:41,920 --> 00:23:42,750
Thank you.
